<article class="env-lemma" id="0EDI">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EDI">Lemma <span data-tag="0EDI">72.18.6</span>.</a> In the situation of Definition <a href="/tag/0EDF" data-tag="0EDF">72.18.3</a> let $Z_ i \subset Z$ be the irreducible components of dimension $d$. Let $m_ i = \text{length}_{\mathcal{O}_{X, \overline{x}_ i}} (\mathcal{O}_{Z, \overline{x}_ i})$ where $\overline{x}_ i$ is a geometric generic point of $Z_ i$. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  (\mathcal{L}_1 \cdots \mathcal{L}_ d \cdot Z) = \sum m_ i(\mathcal{L}_1 \cdots \mathcal{L}_ d \cdot Z_ i)  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate from Lemma <a href="/tag/0EDE" data-tag="0EDE">72.18.2</a> and the definitions. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>